{"t":"Familiars","s":"familiars-84cb3","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/All_Familiars_Together_7e3999.jpg","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Familiars</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.40.5409<br/>July 25, 2017<br/>Summer Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 450px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Official Concept Artwork of four of the Familiars.\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"229\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/All_Familiars_Together_7e3999.jpg\" width=\"450\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Official Concept Artwork of four of the Familiars.</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Familiars</b>, also known as <b>Special Summons</b> or <b>Mighty Summons</b>, can be summoned by all <a href=\"#/wiki/Vocation\">Vocations</a> using a Spell that is available for players above level 200. These summons are very strong and have some key differences when compared to those created using the Summon Creature spell. They used to be called just Summons until the Winter Update 2020, when players became able to obtain multiple \"outfits\" for them.\n</p><p>The new spells were the target of a Dev Note on March 02, 2017, but the Dev Note did not reveal details about the spells, only that they were considering making it cost Soul Points.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Characteristics\">Characteristics</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Their speed is the same as their master's.</li>\n<li>If they get too far behind their master, they teleport themselves to him/her.</li>\n<li>They automatically go up and down ramps, stairs, etc., as well as travel together when their master uses any <a href=\"#/wiki/Travelling\">travel system</a> or teleport.</li>\n<li>When they are not in battle, their health regenerates very quickly.</li>\n<li>Your summon will only remain active for 15 minutes. This timer doesn't run when your character is offline or while they are Swimming. However, while you're Swimming, the cooldown for your summon spell does indeed decrease.</li>\n<li>They are not allowed in fights against Lever Bosses.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<p>The Familiars do not exist as wild creatures in the game, but only in summon form.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable full-width\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Link</th>\n<th>Vocation</th>\n<th>HP</th>\n<th>Abilities\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin%20Familiar\">Paladin Familiar</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Emberwing\"><img alt=\"Emberwing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Emberwing_ce2533.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladin</a></td>\n<td>15000</td>\n<td>Melee (0-200?), <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">Great Fireball</a> (170-230?), Great Holyball (170-230?), <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Bomb</a> (200-270?), Holy Bomb (200-270?), Self-Healing (450)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid%20Familiar\">Druid Familiar</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grovebeast\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grovebeast_f98046.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a></td>\n<td>20000</td>\n<td>Melee (0-300?), Root Missile (230-260?), Earth Beam (2 sqm) (90-150?), Self-Healing (600), <a href=\"#/wiki/Challenge\">Challenge</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight%20Familiar\">Knight Familiar</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Skullfrost\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skullfrost_309233.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a></td>\n<td>10000</td>\n<td>Melee (0-200?), <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Strike\">Ice Strike</a> (300-350?), <a href=\"#/wiki/Sudden%20Death\">Sudden Death</a> (300-350?), plus-shaped <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">Ice Explosion</a> (200-250?), plus-shaped Death Explosion (200-250?), Ice Bomb (180-250?), Death Bomb (180-250?), Self-Healing (300)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer%20Familiar\">Sorcerer Familiar</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Thundergiant\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Thundergiant_2ba2b0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a></td>\n<td>20000</td>\n<td>Melee (0-280?), Energy Beam (2 sqm, 190-210?), <a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\">Blood Beam</a> (2 sqm, 90-150?), Self-Healing (600), <a href=\"#/wiki/Challenge\">Challenge</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Monk%20Familiar\">Monk Familiar</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Omniphant\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Omniphant_2daeff.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">Monk</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Familiars\">Familiars</span></h2>\n<p>Different Mighty Summons for the same vocation are denominated Familiars. The only difference between familiars is their names and outfit sprites. The first four familiars were implemented with the Summer Update 2017. Additional familiars were implemented in the Winter Update 2020. The familiar that will be summoned can be viewed and selected in the \"Customize Character\" dialog.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Paladin\n</th>\n<th>Druid\n</th>\n<th>Knight\n</th>\n<th>Sorcerer\n</th>\n<th>Monk\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Link\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Emberwing\">Emberwing</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Emberwing\"><img alt=\"Emberwing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Emberwing_ce2533.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandscourge\">Sandscourge</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandscourge\"><img alt=\"Sandscourge\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sandscourge_72f337.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Link\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grovebeast</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grovebeast\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grovebeast_f98046.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mossmasher\">Mossmasher</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mossmasher\"><img alt=\"Mossmasher\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mossmasher_cfe142.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Link\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Skullfrost</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Skullfrost\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skullfrost_309233.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Snowbash\">Snowbash</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Snowbash\"><img alt=\"Snowbash\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snowbash_7dc7de.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Link\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Thundergiant</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Thundergiant\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Thundergiant_2ba2b0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Bladespark\">Bladespark</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bladespark\"><img alt=\"Bladespark\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bladespark_ea3dcb.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Link\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Omniphant</td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Omniphant\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Omniphant_2daeff.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Moonhunter\">Moonhunter</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Moonhunter\"><img alt=\"Moonhunter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Moonhunter_82e091.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Matching_Figurines\">Matching Figurines</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Paladin\n</th>\n<th>Druid\n</th>\n<th>Knight\n</th>\n<th>Sorcerer\n</th>\n<th>Monk\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Emberwing%20Figurine\">Emberwing Figurine</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Emberwing%20Figurine\"><img alt=\"Emberwing Figurine\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Emberwing_Figurine_6cd02c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandscourge%20Figurine\">Sandscourge Figurine</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandscourge%20Figurine\"><img alt=\"Sandscourge Figurine\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sandscourge_Figurine_404d74.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Grovebeast%20Figurine\">Grovebeast Figurine</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Grovebeast%20Figurine\"><img alt=\"Grovebeast Figurine\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grovebeast_Figurine_13be5e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Mossmasher%20Figurine\">Mossmasher Figurine</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mossmasher%20Figurine\"><img alt=\"Mossmasher Figurine\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mossmasher_Figurine_7d7564.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Skullfrost%20Figurine\">Skullfrost Figurine</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Skullfrost%20Figurine\"><img alt=\"Skullfrost Figurine\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skullfrost_Figurine_c78288.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Snowbash%20Figurine\">Snowbash Figurine</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Snowbash%20Figurine\"><img alt=\"Snowbash Figurine\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snowbash_Figurine_31b1b1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Thundergiant%20Figurine\">Thundergiant Figurine</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Thundergiant%20Figurine\"><img alt=\"Thundergiant Figurine\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Thundergiant_Figurine_119dc7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Bladespark%20Figurine\">Bladespark Figurine</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bladespark%20Figurine\"><img alt=\"Bladespark Figurine\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bladespark_Figurine_d92781.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Omniphant%20Figurine\">Omniphant Figurine</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Omniphant%20Figurine\"><img alt=\"Omniphant Figurine\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Omniphant_Figurine_850744.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Moonhunter%20Figurine\">Moonhunter Figurine</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Moonhunter%20Figurine\"><img alt=\"Moonhunter Figurine\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Moonhunter_Figurine_496e3e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Spells\">Spells</span></h2>\n<p>Each Familiar has its own exclusive spell that can only be learned by the corresponding vocation. The spells have a Cooldown of 30 minutes, meaning it's not possible for a character to have their summon all the time. Because of that, knowing when to cast the spell is very important to maximize its use.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Words\n</th>\n<th>Prem\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Level\n</th>\n<th>Vocations\n</th>\n<th>Mana\n</th>\n<th>Group\n</th>\n<th>Effect\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Summon%20Druid%20Familiar\">Summon Druid Familiar</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Summon%20Druid%20Familiar\"><img alt=\"Summon Druid Familiar\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Summon_Druid_Familiar_49f567.gif\" width=\"38\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">utevo gran res dru</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">200\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">3000\n</td>\n<td>Support\n</td>\n<td>Summons a <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid%20Familiar\">Druid Familiar</a> which lasts 15 minutes.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Summon%20Knight%20Familiar\">Summon Knight Familiar</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Summon%20Knight%20Familiar\"><img alt=\"Summon Knight Familiar\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Summon_Knight_Familiar_92ce04.gif\" width=\"38\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">utevo gran res eq</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">200\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">1000\n</td>\n<td>Support\n</td>\n<td>Summons a <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight%20Familiar\">Knight Familiar